<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθεος</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without God, denying the
				gods</i>, esp. those recognized by the state, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				26c
			</span></i>, etc.: applied to Diagoras, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>ND</u>
				1.23.63
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράδειγμα ἄ.</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				176e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>godless, ungodly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.162
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				151
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1036
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					6.32
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					2.5.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>abandoned of the gods</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				661
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					10.109
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>not derived from</i> the name of a <i>god</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνόματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.
					63
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>
			<i>by the anger of heaven</i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.3
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐφθαρμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					254
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				1181
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατα</span>
			<i>in most unholy wise</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				124
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
